{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51535","headline":"永和县上巳 · 王驾","name":"永和县上巳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"记得兰亭祓禊辰，今朝兼是永和春。\n一觞一咏无诗侣，病倚山窗忆故人。\n（桑世昌《兰亭考》十二（陆心源《宋诗纪事补遗》卷八八收此诗於事蹟无考作者内。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}